.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-17T22:51:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-17T22:51:39Z","body":"As of writing it's a bit difficult for me to. There's a possibility someone has made a similar proposal with a mockup, possibly as an attempt to rework the Project Manager, but I can't say for sure.\r\n\r\nThe essence would be that, if more than one folder was defined, all of the folders would appear as foldable sections, and each folder would contain its respective projects.\r\n\r\nI wouldn't change the PR from my comment alone, however. More feedback would be required if necessary.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5008259031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5008288834","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121517#issuecomment-5008288834","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121517","id":5008288834,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKoRsQg","user":{"login":"unit-tick","id":267148939,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-xeiw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267148939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick","html_url":"https://github.com/unit-tick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-17T22:55:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-17T22:55:48Z","body":"I wasn't planning on changing if right away, just wanted a better idea of what you meant. I'm waiting for some reviews before making any visual changes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5008288834/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5061794136","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121517#issuecomment-5061794136","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121517","id":5061794136,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLbTZWA","user":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T18:11:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T18:11:39Z","body":"I do think, from a pure accessibility and usability PoV, what Mickeon raises makes far more sense. The list of directories could initially be collapsed or fully expanded, and then as the user expands/collapses directories, that state is maintained across restarts. Otherwise, a user has to interact with two independent controls, which may not provide the right level of accessibility for some.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5061794136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5061816341","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121517#issuecomment-5061816341","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121517","id":5061816341,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLbUwFQ","user":{"login":"unit-tick","id":267148939,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-xeiw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267148939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick","html_url":"https://github.com/unit-tick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-23T18:14:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T18:15:55Z","body":"I'll look into it, but I wanted some code centric reviews before I made any visual changes. However, it seems I'll have to wait a bit longer before someone looks at the code so I see what I can achieve in the mean time","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5061816341/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5081799133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121517#issuecomment-5081799133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121517","id":5081799133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLuYZ3Q","user":{"login":"unit-tick","id":267148939,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-xeiw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267148939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick","html_url":"https://github.com/unit-tick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unit-tick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-26T03:29:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-26T03:29:51Z","body":"@Naros there are some further concerns with the foldable sections implementation, mainly how scan projects and import projects would work. Installing a project allowed the installation directory to be automatically be added if it wasn't already in the directory list, but a project was only added to the active directory when importing, and scanning also only scanned the active directory.\r\n\r\nThe scan issue can be solved by auto-scanning, but that might pose a problem for users that have removed a project from the list and don't want it to automatically be added back into the list. Another solution is to simply disable the scan button.\r\n\r\nThe import issue cannot be this simply solved as importing a project normally uses the directory of the project, the user does not get to select their own directory the same way they can when installing a project.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5081799133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]